"""Knowledge graph (mcp-memory JSONL) -> interactive HTML visualizer.

Static : kgraph static <graph.jsonl> [-o | --open]     -> writes <graph>.html next to source.
Obsidian: kgraph obsidian <graph.jsonl> [-o DIR | --out DIR] -> export graph to Obsidian Markdown notes (YAML + [[wiki-links]]).
Serve  : kgraph serve <graph.jsonl> [-p N | --port N] [--host H] [-no | --no-open] [-b]   live HTTP view, page auto-updates.
         -b / --background   run as a daemon; several graphs may run at once
                              (each takes the next free port starting from --port).
List   : kgraph list (alias: ps)                  -> show running background servers.
Stop   : kgraph stop <id|port|name> | --all       -> stop one server or all.
Man    : kgraph man                                -> show this manual page.

Author : withersky
